{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:0.1", "PA_ja_222:0.2", "PA_ja_222:0.3"], "en": "Jātaka: The Second Book of Birth Stories (Dukanipāta), Chapter on the Yellow Robe (Kāsāvavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:0.4", "PA_ja_222:1.1", "PA_ja_222:1.2"], "en": "2. The Cūḷanandiyajātaka: “This was the teacher’s word, what Pārāsariya spoke at that time.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:1.3"], "en": "Do not commit evil,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:1.4"], "en": "lest that which you have done later cause you remorse;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.1"], "en": "for whatever a person does...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.2"], "en": "He sees them within himself:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.3"], "en": "the doer of good sees the good,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.4"], "en": "and the doer of evil sees the evil.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.5"], "en": "“As one sows the seed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:2.6"], "en": "so one reaps the fruit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_222:3.1"], "en": "Thus ends the second Jātaka, the Cūḷanandiya Jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
]
